---
description: Push to remote only after explicit user approval
alwaysApply: true
---

# Push Gating Rule

- Never run `git push` unless the user explicitly asks to push in the current conversation.
- After making local edits, stop at local changes/commit and ask for user review when push intent is not explicit.
- If the user asks to "push", "publish", or "上传 GitHub", pushing is allowed.
